 you like Anime? Do you like fighting games? Then Encounters is the experience for you! \n\nUse your abilities to best your enemies in a fast paced last man standing brawl arena! \n\nWith a large amount of champions and infinite ability combo strategies, there will always be new things to explore. \n\n⚔️ Choose Between 30+ unique champions \n👥 Play with Friends in 2v2, 1v1, and FFA ability-based combat \n🏆 Win competitive matches to earn Trophies \n🗝️ Unlock exclusive Champions and Skins \n💪 Practice against bots \n\nTags: fighting, combat, face off, arena, champions, competitive, casual, tournament, multiplayer \n\n🎮 Brought to you by Voldex! 🎮","path":"/game/7499189111-encounters","slug":"7499189111-encounters","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a4f69ada465fd29f089fa410430a1af796335420324cb509962e99dac552c584.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e26a36bd51bd98672e70b948b5994709/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":24,"visitor":406500451,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-07-17T22:18:07.040Z","creator":{"name":"Encounters by Voldex","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":180364455,"name":"⚡️Survive The Disasters 2","desc":"V2.01.2\n\n!! GAMEPASS ITEMS REGARDING V2.0 !! \nGamepass items won't spawn in your backpack with the new saved backpack system for the first time. You will have to get gamepass items from the SHOP (they're still free, of course) to have them spawn on your backpack again when you rejoin. These items will stay in your backpack for 7 days, then you can re-rent them for free once they expire.\n\n\n💰 2X COINS ON FRIDAYS AND SATURDAYS!\n\nSurvive dangerous disasters ranging from natural to artificial hazards! Surviving will award you coins which are used to buy items that will help aid you. Survive more, earn more, get better gear, and even upgrade your gears!\n\nMain composer: SkyTheFloof","path":"/game/180364455-survive-the-disasters-2","slug":"180364455-survive-the-disasters-2",